{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-teen-brain-technology","revision":1,"title_en":"Mind Games: Technology and the Developing Teenage Brain","title_zh":"心智博弈：数字科技与发育中的青少年大脑","level":"B2","primary_topic":"technology","tags":["technology","neuroscience","adolescence","frontiers"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"神经科学研究显示，青少年时期社会情感网络（处理奖赏与同伴反馈）与认知控制网络（负责规划与冲动控制）的发育节奏存在时差，这解释了为何在线点赞和通知格外诱人。大规模调查揭示了适度屏幕使用的“金发姑娘假说”，即极少或极度沉迷均伴随较低主观幸福感，而主动的高品质数字互动（如创作、视频学习与深度交流）有助于身心健康。科学家建议青少年建立规律作息并保护睡眠，实现对数字生活的理性自主掌控。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T14:33:35Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Nearly every teenager today uses digital devices to communicate, learn, and explore personal interests.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"如今，几乎每个青少年都会使用数字设备来进行交流、学习以及探索个人兴趣。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":6,"surface":"Nearly","lemma":"nearly","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"几乎；差不多"},{"start":7,"end":12,"surface":"every","lemma":"every","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"每一个"},{"start":13,"end":21,"surface":"teenager","lemma":"teenager","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"青少年"},{"start":22,"end":27,"surface":"today","lemma":"today","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"如今；在现今"},{"start":28,"end":32,"surface":"uses","lemma":"use","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"使用"},{"start":33,"end":40,"surface":"digital","lemma":"digital","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"数字的；数码的"},{"start":41,"end":48,"surface":"devices","lemma":"device","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"设备；装置"},{"start":49,"end":51,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式符号","gloss_zh":"引出目的动作"},{"start":52,"end":63,"surface":"communicate","lemma":"communicate","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"交流；沟通"},{"start":65,"end":70,"surface":"learn","lemma":"learn","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"学习"},{"start":72,"end":75,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"和；并"},{"start":76,"end":83,"surface":"explore","lemma":"explore","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"探索；探求"},{"start":84,"end":92,"surface":"personal","lemma":"personal","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"个人的；私人的"},{"start":93,"end":102,"surface":"int